    "detailed_description": "<h1>BRAGI EST\u00daDIOS</h1><p>We are an indie studio from Bahia, Brazil. We are, in addition to developers, creators of experiences. MOOH is our first project for PC and we are very excited to share it with you.<br><br>We want to build our games with you! Join our community and become a playtester:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FINANCIAL SUPPORT</h2>This project was included in the Paulo Gustavo Bahia Notices and has financial support from the Government of the State of Bahia (Brazil) through the Secretariat of Culture of Brazil via the Paulo Gustavo Law, directed by the Ministry of Culture, Brazilian Federal Government. Paulo Gustavo Bahia (PGBA) was created to carry out emergency actions to support the cultural sector, aiming to comply with Complementary Law No. 195, of July 8, 2022.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/f265c02689063efc32b60d43b4f368ab.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=230 /></span><br><br>Explore the universe in this cyberpunk single-player, with a little cow that will leave you upside down.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/c877c8fe4d070c4ffe70aee0ea9f0a02.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=140 /></span><br><br>There are several folk tales and urban legends about aliens abducting cows, but what happens to the cows after they are abducted?<br>On a peaceful planet inhabited by cows that only walk, graze and fart, an innocent cow is abducted to a strange planet and placed in a prison.<br>Once she manages to escape, she begins to explore the new world looking for ways to return home.<br>What was once just another cow in the pasture becomes an individual with personality, fears and desires.<br>Your journey goes beyond discovering other worlds: it is a discovery of yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/92260264a7fdb5a0a57d888494027f65.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=140 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >360\u00ba PLATAFORM</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/071881fd8b2ecab60ce22c6404d1a3a6.poster.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/071881fd8b2ecab60ce22c6404d1a3a6.webm?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/071881fd8b2ecab60ce22c6404d1a3a6.mp4?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Move around the entire planet and make the ceiling turn into the floor with gravity switching mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPAIR THE SHIP</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/c0c12713727f35cf5ba79d6eeca18239.poster.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/c0c12713727f35cf5ba79d6eeca18239.webm?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/c0c12713727f35cf5ba79d6eeca18239.mp4?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Find and collect the necessary parts to repair a broken ship and take the character away from there.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEAT ENEMIES AND SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/da2fb5770344e970c07d01f889ad47c4.poster.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/da2fb5770344e970c07d01f889ad47c4.webm?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/da2fb5770344e970c07d01f889ad47c4.mp4?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each planet will have different enemies to defeat and puzzles to solve. Think carefully before making a move: it could be your last!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MIMOSAS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/1a449ae31c9b30211759758efdec182f.poster.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/1a449ae31c9b30211759758efdec182f.webm?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/1a449ae31c9b30211759758efdec182f.mp4?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Mooh wasn't the only one to be abducted! To save other cows, which we affectionately call \u201cmimosas\u201d, you need to find the cells in which they are trapped and free them. The mimosas join you inside the ship as traveling companions.<br>The more mimosas you set free, a different skin you'll see!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN NEW SKILLS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/9987ce191d61331920c3927fc30d3017.poster.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/9987ce191d61331920c3927fc30d3017.webm?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Inside the ship, Mooh can learn new skills that will help you explore the next planet.  Most skills can be used both for puzzles and to attack enemies.<br>With each skill learned, more cyberpunk Mooh becomes!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/f265c02689063efc32b60d43b4f368ab.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=230 /></span><br><br>Explore the universe in this cyberpunk single-player, with a little cow that will leave you upside down.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/c877c8fe4d070c4ffe70aee0ea9f0a02.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=140 /></span><br><br>There are several folk tales and urban legends about aliens abducting cows, but what happens to the cows after they are abducted?<br>On a peaceful planet inhabited by cows that only walk, graze and fart, an innocent cow is abducted to a strange planet and placed in a prison.<br>Once she manages to escape, she begins to explore the new world looking for ways to return home.<br>What was once just another cow in the pasture becomes an individual with personality, fears and desires.<br>Your journey goes beyond discovering other worlds: it is a discovery of yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/92260264a7fdb5a0a57d888494027f65.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=140 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >360\u00ba PLATAFORM</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/071881fd8b2ecab60ce22c6404d1a3a6.poster.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/071881fd8b2ecab60ce22c6404d1a3a6.webm?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/071881fd8b2ecab60ce22c6404d1a3a6.mp4?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Move around the entire planet and make the ceiling turn into the floor with gravity switching mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPAIR THE SHIP</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/c0c12713727f35cf5ba79d6eeca18239.poster.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/c0c12713727f35cf5ba79d6eeca18239.webm?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/c0c12713727f35cf5ba79d6eeca18239.mp4?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Find and collect the necessary parts to repair a broken ship and take the character away from there.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEAT ENEMIES AND SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/da2fb5770344e970c07d01f889ad47c4.poster.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/da2fb5770344e970c07d01f889ad47c4.webm?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/da2fb5770344e970c07d01f889ad47c4.mp4?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each planet will have different enemies to defeat and puzzles to solve. Think carefully before making a move: it could be your last!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MIMOSAS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/1a449ae31c9b30211759758efdec182f.poster.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/1a449ae31c9b30211759758efdec182f.webm?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/1a449ae31c9b30211759758efdec182f.mp4?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Mooh wasn't the only one to be abducted! To save other cows, which we affectionately call \u201cmimosas\u201d, you need to find the cells in which they are trapped and free them. The mimosas join you inside the ship as traveling companions.<br>The more mimosas you set free, a different skin you'll see!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN NEW SKILLS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/9987ce191d61331920c3927fc30d3017.poster.avif?t=1740761344\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030950/extras/9987ce191d61331920c3927fc30d3017.webm?t=1740761344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Inside the ship, Mooh can learn new skills that will help you explore the next planet.  Most skills can be used both for puzzles and to attack enemies.<br>With each skill learned, more cyberpunk Mooh becomes!",
